\f0\fs24 \cf2 This armor, displayed in the museum, is accompanied by an authentic 19th-century sketch. A curious detail: the sword that once accompanied the armor is no longer there, but instead, it is placed on the opposite wall. Despite these changes, the preservation of the object has kept the original idea of how the armor was intended to be displayed, offering those who view it an experience that seems to transport them back in time.}